Error [E3401]: `draw` calls the impure function `core_core_math_random::__word`
  --> tests/ui/effect_math_random_in_pure_fn.jet:3:36
    |
  3 | fn draw() -[]> Float Never! { math.random() }
    |                                    ^^^^^^
 Why: Draw → core_math::random calls `core_core_math_random::__word`, which is impure — the whole call chain must be pure inside `draw`
 Fix: Remove the call to `core_core_math_random::__word`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `draw` so its effects are inferred
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: draw → core_math::random → core_core_math_random::__word
